{"reviews":[{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-0","r":2.0,"t":"Missing Pins","x":"The product is sturdy and the head is very solid. BUT... I purchased this specific head and clamp because it stated that it came with T pins. Well there weren't any in the package therefore making this products description very misleading. I am honestly not very happy with that at all.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Nice  mannequin head","x":"As pictured. I\u2019ve used it a few times since purchasing. Pins fit nicely to hold wig to head. No big noticeable holes, very sturdy. Rotatable. I love mine","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Good","x":"She works really great. I have no problem getting the T Pins in and out of her head. She works great and holds on good with the tripod stand I purchased too. The C Clamp that came with her works good too. Just make sure you have a few inches of counter sticking out so when you push her head down or back the clamp doesn\u2019t slip off.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-3","r":3.0,"t":"Ok","x":"The mannequins head is OK but stand not worth....","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-4","r":3.0,"t":"Misleading description, would have given more stars","x":"Head is an inch shorter than what\u2019s stated in the description. I choose this head over other cheaper heads, because I read that it should be 11 inches. I needed the extra inches for my longer wigs. Sadly, what I\u2019ve received is only 10 inches tall. ((Also, I\u2019m okay with this but \u2014the head even has different features from what\u2019s shown here. )) Other than these observations, it\u2019s a pretty standard head. I used it to detangle my wigs, and to store the short one.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Well worth the money.","x":"My purchase came in time. This mannequin works really well. The scalp is very sturdy and the T-pins go in smoothly and stay put. I generally purchase 360 or full lace units and have not had any tearing area all. Having this head makes it much easier to comb out tangles and drying after washing or roller setting is so much faster and smoother. Will purchase again so that I can set more than one unit at a time.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great to practice makeup lewks!!!","x":"Works perfectly for my daughter to practice makeup. Washes off REALLY well with cleansing oil, took no effort. Does need glitter glue or similar product for shimmer shades to build up but mattes work well.  Pic shows how she wears makeup and how she looks after removal.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-7","r":4.0,"t":"Not bad","x":"Box was damaged. Doll head was slightly damage. Doll is nice, holder is weak.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Really nice","x":"My sister really been busy since she received it. Making amazing wigs","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-9","r":4.0,"t":"Female Professional Cosmetology Bald Mannequin Head","x":"I bought this Female Bald Mannequin head to use for wigs. It came with a tools that hooks up to the table but there is no place for hooking up the head. It is definitely missing a piece of the puzzle. I  did not want to return it. I kept it and I make it stand without the tool. Overall, it is sturdy and a great value for the money...","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-10","r":5.0,"t":"perfect size for small wigs","x":"The head was to replace Styrofoam heads that are angled to the side for wig storage and it is perfect because it sits straight forward and I can style the hair knowing it will be correct. Also, the wigs will not be stretched out from being on oversized heads. a very good price, I would have expected to pay more.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-11","r":4.0,"t":"the quality of dummy was so good to display hats and scarfs","x":"Delivery was fast. At first, it was confusing that how I should use that stand because I never dealt with dummies before. but after watching a tutorial I figured it out. overall, the quality of dummy was so good to display hats and scarfs.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Mannequin Head for Photography Practice","x":"This head is perfect for practicing lighting techniques in my photography studio. I wanted something cheaper as it would not get used much and this head does the trick.  I found a wig for $10 and now I am set to practice!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-13","r":3.0,"t":"Okay to Use","x":"Well it came as it look. The gift is pretty cheap so some stuff broke off pretty quickly but i was able to fix it. Their is no instruction so if your a first timer LOOK AT THE PICTURES as instruction","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product.","x":"Great product. I'm happy it arrived quickly and is exactly as described.  Looking forward to using it to display hats that I make.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-15","r":5.0,"t":"As described","x":"Product is as described, had a chemical smell, but went away.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-16","r":3.0,"t":"Its ok","x":"Nit bad just kept coming off and wasnt sturdy  enough","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"Perfect for my wigs. I will be buying more.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value & Good Quality","x":"This is a great mannequin head for the money!  I purchased this to take better pictures of my crochet work, and the head works well with or without the clamp.  It's got some weight to it, which makes it easier to set up for pictures.  I recommend this.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Eady to work with.","x":"Purchased this to help customize my wigs. Needed a face to align wigs correctly. Works ad described. Gits stand perfectly. Love this product and as I customize wigs or make my own from scratch i have a bettet idea how itneill look on my head.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Brow mapping is great !  Read ...!!","x":"Seller was more than honest about wax pencil removal for brow mapping ...  BUT it works !!  Oil or acetone removes the practice wax pencil this is awesome to practice on a face upright ...  so excited !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-21","r":1.0,"t":"Don't buy,head to small","x":"I was very disappointed with this purchase the head is way to small ,after making a wig I had to throw it away ,wasn't able to wear it it would fit a 5 year old head probably a 1 year old head ...","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-22","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointment","x":"This product is very cheap in quality and is not worth the money I made for it. It also was missing the hair pins that was supposed to come with it. I am very very disappointed with this product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-23","r":4.0,"t":"Good buy!","x":"The mannequin head is great for my wigs, however the head is smaller than the average human head so my wigs which measure small are a little big for the mannequin head, but overall a good buy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B097R4H8FZ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and Works Perfectly!","x":"She's beautiful and we have the same size head!! It's not hard to use push pins either, just the right softness. She works so much better than the foam heads. I recommend and would buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the head sturdy and well-made, with T-pins going in smoothly and staying put.","cites":[2,3,6,10]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product description is misleading, citing missing T-pins or a head shorter than stated.","cites":[1,5]},{"text":"The stand or clamp is a common weak point, with some describing it as weak or not worth it.","cites":[4,8,10]},{"text":"Reviewers commonly use it successfully for wigs, makeup practice, and displaying hats or scarves.","cites":[7,9,11,12,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note missing parts or no instructions, making setup confusing for first-timers.","cites":[10,14]}]},"qa":[]}